          "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be essentially surjective and fully\nfaithful. As by convention all categories are small and as <MATH_0002> is essentially\nsurjective we can, using the axiom of choice, choose for every\n<MATH_0003> an object <MATH_0004> of <MATH_0005> and an\nisomorphism <MATH_0006>. Then we apply\nLemma <REF_0001>\nusing that <MATH_0007> is fully faithful.\n",
